# Managed files of this release, one path per line, relative to the instance
# root. These are replaced wholesale on upgrade [D-1] and hashed into
# .megabrain/lock.json at install time [D-4]. A release declares its own set so
# that adding or removing a managed file upgrades correctly [D-21].
