# AGENTS.md and megabrain.md are deliberately absent: they are managed in
# structure and instance-owned in content [D-2], never overwritten, never
# hashed. Everything else shipped under template/ is instance-owned starter
# content the user may edit or delete freely.
#
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.

